  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strong Women Programme - Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure responsive and inclusive engagement of women and girls in political life from grassroots to national levels, leading to equal access to justice for all; and promote women&#x2019;s economic empowerment and equal opportunities to participate in the labour market with sustainable access to economic resources in the Mara, Dodoma, Mbeya and Songwe regions in Tanzania</narrative>
  </description>
